---
description: Ticket agent conventions
alwaysApply: true
---
- LLM proposes, router.py decides. Put escalation logic in code with a unit test.
- Ticket text is untrusted: keep it inside <ticket> tags, never merge into system prompts.
- Any failure routes to human_review; never crash the batch.
- Version prompts in prompts/ and bump PROMPT_VERSION when editing.
- Run `make test` before finishing a change.
